/*--------------------------------------------
 Le Grand simplified eye: RELAXED (relaxed)

 Source: TEVOI (Smith & Atchison, The Eye and Visual Optical Instruments, Cambridge University Press 1997), Appendix 3 'Schematic eyes', p. 786, Le Grand: Simplified relaxed.
 One refracting cornea (R 8.0 mm, n 1.336), aqueous 1.336, a lens of ZERO thickness (R 10.2, -6.0 mm, n 1.4208).
 The iris plane is placed so the entrance pupil is where Le Grand's exact eye has it (3.6 mm from the cornea in the relaxed eye).
 Eye power 59.952 D, length 24.192 mm. Nothing has been added to the published eye. The 4 mm stop is the app's usual pupil.
----------------------------------------------*/
